Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot edit through `n` — it has read access only
  --> tests/ui/plain_call_changes_read_parameter.jet:8:10
    |
  8 |     bump(n, 1)
    |          ^
 Why: `bump: fn(n: &Int, by: Int)` changes this input, but an unmarked parameter gives read access only
 Fix: Change the parameter to `n: &Int`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
